  The reel_script says the Central Crime Branch police arrested 8 people, but the article only says Kannagi, Muthukumaran, Monisha and 8 others were arrested; the sentence mixes details so 'உள்பட 8 பேர்' is ambiguous, though the count of 8 is in the article.
