  The reel_script and slides say the money was transferred to another bank account 'குறிப்பிட்ட வங்கிக் கணக்கிற்கு' without the article's key detail that the loan was taken in each student's name for one lakh rupees, which the script does state; however the script omits that the arrested accused were detained so the arrest itself is mentioned, but the slides wrongly assign 'மாணவர் பெயரில் ஒரு லட்சம் ரூபாய் வீதம் கடன் பெறப்பட்டது' as a fact of Kannagi's actions, which is acceptable.
