  The reel_script says the fraud was in 'சேலம் மாநகரில்' (Salem city), but the article describes the case as handled by Salem city Central Crime Branch and the fraud spanning Salem, Namakkal and Dharmapuri districts; the headline's 'சேலம் மாநகரம்' location is a framing choice not explicitly stated as the fraud's location.
